mango-settings (2.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Schema now covers every top-level option MangoWM parses (bars and
    decorations, jump labels, overview and hotarea, special tag, gestures,
    advanced rendering, per-device rules).
  * Rule editors rewritten for Mango's key:value record syntax with
    validation (monitor, tag, window, layer, device rules).
  * External config change detection with a reload banner, backup manager,
    config export/import, per-page reset to defaults, custom accent color.
  * Inline validation feedback instead of modal dialogs, debounced search,
    and a headless --selftest for CI.

 -- Harikesh Verma <code-smith404@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 26 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

mango-settings (2.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Redesigned after the official MangoWM web settings: collapsible sidebar
    groups, header bar with search and undo/redo, web-style cards and rows.
  * New pages: Environment Variables, Colors, Window Effects, Cursor,
    Tiling/Dwindle/Scroller, Keyboard/Pointer/Trackpad, Animation
    General/Timing/Curves, Focus/Drag/Scratchpad and Layer/Tag rules.

